flowchart TB
    HS[HTTP headers, then HTTP 200]
    HS --> SOCK[Same TLS socket stays open]

    SOCK --> UP[Client envelopes]
    SOCK --> DOWN[Camera envelopes]

    UP --> PREVIEW[start preview]
    UP --> ACK[ack every 25 video parts]
    UP --> BEAT[heartbeat every 20 seconds]

    DOWN --> JSON[JSON control, including session id]
    DOWN --> TS[video/mp2t MPEG-TS]
    TS --> FF[ffplay]
